    "text": ".\nOne of the most interactive dining concepts in Berlin!🌶️🥢\n\nAt Mao Master Berlin you build your own bowl exactly the way you like it. Choose from a wide selection of fresh vegetables, meats, seafood, mushrooms, noodles, and other ingredients, then pick your favorite broth or sauce and let the kitchen do the rest.\n\n📍 Kantstraße 50, 10625 Berlin\n\nThe result is a meal that’s different every time you visit, whether you prefer a comforting soup, a rich beef broth, or the bold flavors of Sichuan-style mala.\n\nA fun concept, generous selection, and a great spot to customize your meal exactly to your taste.\n\n#Berlintaster #MaoMaster #BerlinFood #BerlinEats #Ad",
